<title>USA: Equity Residential buys 12 properties.</title>
<headline>Equity Residential buys 12 properties.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Residential Properties Trust said Wednesday it had bought 12 residential properties in separate deals for a total of $227.5 million.</p>
<p>The company said it bought the apartment complexes with a total of 3,931 units in nine separate transactions.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the company said it had closed the deals during the last few months with a number of sellers in seven states including Texas and California.</p>
<p>The company also said it had sold three properties for a total of about $30 million, earning a profit of $3.8 million.</p>
<p>Two of the properties were located in Pennsylvania, while the third was in Lithonia, Georgia, it said.</p>
